{"id":"wb-5-356","name":"法王寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"法王寺 (登封)","text":"法王寺位于河南登封嵩山太室山南麓，中国最早的寺院之一。\n法王寺依山而建。寺东有两座山峰，形状如门称“嵩门”。每逢中秋夜晚，一轮皓月从这门洞中徐徐升起，法王寺“嵩门待月”被称为嵩山八景之一。\n法王寺周围现存有塔6座，其中包括建于唐代的法王寺塔。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E7%8E%8B%E5%AF%BA_(%E7%99%BB%E5%B0%81)","revisionId":90954762,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90954762","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fc3acb1af886336f56e4769e.jpg","title":"20251101_Pagoda_No._1_of_Fawang_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20251101_Pagoda_No._1_of_Fawang_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/20251101_Pagoda_No._1_of_Fawang_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​法王寺1号塔","width":320,"height":480}}